      "en": "The LORD appeared to him by the oaks of Mamre, as he sat in the tent door in the heat of the day.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 마므레 상수리 수풀 근처에서 아브라함에게 나타나시니라 오정 즈음에 그가 장막 문에 앉았다가",
      "source_text_hash": "dd7912be01fa055ec23c267c17e45413aa281095c9633384bdac896dba55ecb6",
      "translation_text_hash": "c0c35c36b00accf83220b75e6fc78c59aa30e9b68585626b5e3a8e76ad639f0f",
