      "en": "Abraham came near, and said, “Will you consume the righteous with the wicked?",
      "ko": "가까이 나아가 가로되 주께서 의인을 악인과 함께 멸하시려나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "d9c6cf20f270293032dfa704c2861f750c5c8cec250d3426c63825f46adf86d6",
      "translation_text_hash": "d3c06cb5999aae13752e2df5eec6a5ffc5c3eae1c3af8431ecb26774a05915ef",
